 "id": "1726120731229844", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75340705_1726120734563177_864537722303111268_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C9pnXaYv4OsQ7kNvwE-7Gyw&_nc_oc=Adoq6W1_Svkcpp9OBOyX6nAHHWOvqMz7qvhvGOnmKCLEgMB9fUQslDRuMtqtMAFAPiU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRZCRd7V_-dbBai_IY9C3T4ByiyHMvuMBxQ9fkMNa560Q&oe=6B0865DE"}, "display_name": "Summer Games VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Summer Games VR offers an immersive virtual reality experience that transports players into a world of athletic prowess and competitive spirit with a variety of engaging modes, including Practice, Single Player, Tournament, and Multiplayer.\n\nThrilling Sports Lineup:\n\nArchery: Test your precision and focus as you aim for the bullseye in this classic event.\nJavelin: Master the art of the javelin throw, harnessing power and accuracy to achieve record distances.\n100m Run: Sprint against the clock and rival athletes in a heart-pounding dash for victory.\n400m Relay Race: Team up with fellow competitors in an exhilarating relay race, passing the baton with split-second timing.\nDiving: Execute graceful dives from varying heights, showcasing elegance and control.\nSwimming: Dive into the pool and power through the water, striving for new personal bests.\nBoxing: Step into the ring, where strategy and quick reflexes are essential to outsmarting your opponent.", "short_description": "Summer Games VR offers an immersive virtual reality experience that transports players into a world of athletic prowess and competitive spirit with a variety of engaging modes, including Practice, Single Player, Tournament, and Multiplayer."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.freeprivacypolicy.com/live/9a19a826-b2f7-469e-9603-d434928e44db", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Texas Ego Films", "support_website_url": null, "website_url